fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gsth265parser.html#gst_h265_parser_insert_sei","fragment":"\n\tgst_h265_parser_insert_sei\n\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H265Parser.prototype.insert_sei\n\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.H265Parser.insert_sei\n\nCopy au into new GstBuffer and insert sei into the GstBuffer.\nThe validation for completeness of au and sei is caller's responsibility.\nBoth au and sei must be byte-stream formatted\nParameters:\na GstH265Parser\na GstBuffer containing AU data\na GstMemory containing a SEI nal\na SEI inserted GstBuffer or NULL\nif cannot figure out proper position to insert a sei\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.18\n\t\t\nCopy au into new Gst.Buffer and insert sei into the Gst.Buffer.\nThe validation for completeness of au and sei is caller's responsibility.\nBoth au and sei must be byte-stream formatted\nParameters:\na GstCodecParsers.H265Parser\na Gst.Buffer containing AU data\na Gst.Memory containing a SEI nal\na SEI inserted Gst.Buffer or null\nif cannot figure out proper position to insert a sei\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.18\n\t\t\nCopy au into new Gst.Buffer and insert sei into the Gst.Buffer.\nThe validation for completeness of au and sei is caller's responsibility.\nBoth au and sei must be byte-stream formatted\nParameters:\na GstCodecParsers.H265Parser\na Gst.Buffer containing AU data\na Gst.Memory containing a SEI nal\na SEI inserted Gst.Buffer or None\nif cannot figure out proper position to insert a sei\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.18\n\t\t\n"});